# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/upload-1 window (docs/tp4-upload1.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-upload-1-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed head of tp4/upload-1 (the ship-5 stack plus the host tier's upload levers, qwen_tier_upload;
# substitute it in every template with one command: sed -i 's/tp4-upload-1-1/<tag>/' *.env). THE TAG MUST BE FRESH: the build step skips a tag that exists. The levers live in files the image carries
# (qwen_tier_upload.py, qwen_prefix_registry.py, qwen_prefix_scheduler_patch.py): an image built before them ignores the three names and the arm reads NOT_EXERCISED (no "host tier upload on" line).
# The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent (production is down by the owner's choice while it runs).
# B0 (STOP, no card opened): build the WINDOW image from the pushed head of tp4/upload-1: the ship-5 profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s5 baked as the serving default with a session cap of 8, plus
# C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ (the ship-5 pack's B1 exactly; the upload levers add no binary, only Python files). THE TAG MUST BE FRESH (a rebuild after a fix needs a NEW tag: a build that finishes in under a
# minute with 'present: sha256' is the old image). READ: "baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s5 with a session cap of 8", the provenance report with no problem line, its K64j-OQ graft line and its
# qwen_kv_read 2 line, the closure checks, the image id. A build, not a card job: no privileged builder
# container may be up and no card job may run during it. Estimate: 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-upload-1-1
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s5
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
